      "orig": "The  products  in  this  manual  are  controlled  based  on  Japan's  'Foreign  Exchange  and Foreign Trade Law'. The export of Series 30 i -B, Series 31 i -B5 from Japan is subject to an export  license  by  the  government  of  Japan.  Other  models  in  this  manual  may  also  be subject to export controls.",
      "text": "The  products  in  this  manual  are  controlled  based  on  Japan's  'Foreign  Exchange  and Foreign Trade Law'. The export of Series 30 i -B, Series 31 i -B5 from Japan is subject to an export  license  by  the  government  of  Japan.  Other  models  in  this  manual  may  also  be subject to export controls."
